\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Leave God to order all thy ways,
\par And hope in Him what'er betide:
\par Thou'lt find Him in the evil days
\par Thy all-sufficient strength and guide:
\par Who trusts in God's unchanging love
\par Builds on the rock that nought can move.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Only thy restless heart keep still,
\par And wait in cheerful hope, content
\par To take whate'er His gracious will,
\par His all-discerning love, hath sent;
\par Nor doubt our inmost wants are known
\par To Him who chose us for His own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Sing, pray, and swerve not from His ways,
\par But do thine own part faithfully;
\par Trust His rich promises of grace,
\par So shall they be fufilled in thee:
\par God never yet forsook at need
\par The soul that trusted Him indeed. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

